{
  "slug": "genesis-governance-claude",
  "name": "Genesis Governance Claude",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Genesis Governance turns a Claude Code project into a governed project. Instead of dropping generic templates, it derives a constitution, governance config, CLAUDE.md, document registry, CI checks, first audit, and specialized agents from a structured 5-layer intake. It works for new projects and brownfield repos, supports checkpoint resume, and includes drift detection through /genesis-sync.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills**, `genesis-governance` (Governance framework genesis protocol for new or existing Claude Code projects), `genesis-sync` (Detects governance drift in Claude Code projects).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install genesis-governance-claude@claude-community` from `siliconbrokers/genesis-governance-claude`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
